        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5e6a49c32f23487ba9f6373f946efa69",
      "statement": "`strip()` removes only a fixed set of Sanity system keys before comparison, and `equal()` performs structural deep equality with order-sensitive arrays so republish decisions are based on meaningful content changes rather than metadata churn or key ordering.",
