      "id": "claim_7a175cfc9acf4cf3af5c6d9e6ea4357e",
      "statement": "`publish.ts` recomputes `searchText` and deterministically keys topic references when building the desired published document, keeping stored content aligned with the client-side search haystack and avoiding nondeterministic array keys.",
