    {
      "id": "claim_7d79e674d8d24ad1801f28df9b660d18",
      "statement": "The publish tests pin the exact mutation arrays submitted to Sanity, which is what protects the strict-create compare-and-set shape from regressing into `createOrReplace`, split transactions, or other unsafe publish variants.",
