      "id": "claim_c32067459f4246628570913aa26aa369",
      "statement": "`src/lib/sanity/studio-config.test.ts` verifies that `slugLock` stays out of the Studio sidebar, the create-new menu, and document actions, matching its role as infrastructure rather than authored content.",
