      "id": "claim_8ef11da319f74f4492656bf9422683da",
      "statement": "The Studio document actions are scoped so that episode documents gain the custom `Sync from Podbean` action after the built-ins, other schema types do not, and the sync action is not a built-in publish replacement.",
